  "title": "Evaluator Quality Compute Problem",
  "description": "Closed RFC 9457 problem documents of experiment_run.compute_evaluator_quality (application/problem+json). Each definition is one closed status/code/type combination from the backend problem catalogue (src/api_kit/problems.py PROBLEMS) with its fixed title, detail and server-minted problem_id (first 32 hex of sha256 of the type URN); nothing the client sent is echoed. evaluator_audit_in_progress is new: 409 is used ONLY for it (another request is computing this run's audit). 429, 503 and 409 may carry a Retry-After header.",
